Washington D.C.- Today, Congressman Robert Garcia (CA-42) spoke at an Oversight Committee hearing to address the baseless impeachment inquiry against President Biden. The inquiry has been launched just 2 days be for e a Republican government shutdown is expected to occur. “We know we’re here today not because of any wrongdoing of President Biden, but rather because Donald Trump wants revenge. He was impeached twice — once for extorting a for eign government by withholding military aid unless they smeared a political opponent — and a second time for sending a mob to stop the certification of an election he knew he lost. So now his most extreme allies — including members of this committee — are retaliating while Kevin McCarthy does NOTHING.” said Congressman Garcia Congressman Garcia is a prominent voice on the Oversight Committee. He has been outspoken about House Republicans’ baseless allegations against President Biden and the disservice this focus does to the American people, especially ahead of a government shutdown. To watch the entire speech please click here . ### Issues : Defending Democracy 33.767301314139 -118.19576409654 CA42 About Biography Biografía en Español Talambuhay sa Tagalog ជីវប្រវត្តិ Committees and Caucuses Congressional Caucus on Peru Congressional PORTS Caucus Congressional YIMBY Caucus Popular Arts Caucus Our District Invitations and Meeting Requests Press Media Inquiries Press Releases In the News Photos Official Congressional Headshot Issues Defending our Democracy Upholding Civil Rights Defending our Oceans, Beaches, and Wetlands Supporting Small Businesses Defending the Right to Abortion Protecting Public Health Eliminating Student Debt Fighting for Immigrant Families Ending the Gun Violence Epidemic Ensuring Healthcare for All Expanding Protections for the LGBTQ+ Community Fighting to Get Big Money out of Politics Providing Safe, Affordable Housing for Every American Raising Wages for Working Families Reducing Emissions Through Green Jo